{
  "date": "2024-06-18",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보고싶었어",
      "en": "I've missed you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "image": "image-01.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "선물이야!",
      "en": "It's a gift!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 뭐하고 지냈어",
      "en": "What have you been up to today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "Pretty",
      "en": "Pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "I know 😉",
      "en": "I know 😉"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 오늘",
      "en": "Today,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한끼밖에 안먹었어",
      "en": "I only had one meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "돈가스",
      "en": "Tonkatsu."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연아 돈까스를 네장이나 먹으면 어떡해",
      "en": "Hayeon, what if you ate four pieces of tonkatsu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "들킨건가",
      "en": "Did I get caught?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 생각보다 끈기있는 여자일지도",
      "en": "Maybe I'm more persistent than I thought."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이번엔 다이어트 성공기미가 보여",
      "en": "I think this diet might actually work this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "콘서트에서 진짜 좋은모습 보여주고싶어",
      "en": "I really want to show you my best side at the concert."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "의미있는 날이니까~",
      "en": "Because it's such a meaningful day~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "큐트하연vs쿨하연",
      "en": "Cute Hayeon vs. Cool Hayeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "둘다",
      "en": "Both."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "둘다 할래",
      "en": "I want to do both."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "안되겠다 내꺼하자",
      "en": "Forget it. Just be mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쉽지 않을걸~~~",
      "en": "That won't be easy~~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연아 사랑해",
      "en": "Hayeon, I love you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도오",
      "en": "Me too~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "늘 사랑하고 고마운거 알지??",
      "en": "You know I always love you and I'm always thankful for you, right??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "❤❤",
      "en": "❤❤"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 실물 깡패인데",
      "en": "Hayeon looks insanely good in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "인정하는 바입니다",
      "en": "I admit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 진짜",
      "en": "Seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "깡패라고..?",
      "en": "A gangster...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어허",
      "en": "Hey now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 조신하고 여린 여자한테",
      "en": "To such a delicate and gentle woman like me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "내마음을 패는 깡패",
      "en": "A gangster who beats up my heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모야 ~심장폭격귀요미 머 이런건강 히히",
      "en": "Aww~ So I'm a heart-attacking cutie or something? Hehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아 뭔가 하연이 눈에 띄는 드립을 치고 싶은데 생각나는게 없다",
      "en": "I want to come up with a joke that'll catch your attention, but I can't think of anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㅎㅋㄹㄹㅋ 드립칠",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생각밖에 안든거야 다들ㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㅎ",
      "en": "Is making jokes really the only thing on everyone's mind? ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "너가웃으면나도좋으니까...",
      "en": "Because if you smile, I'll be happy too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야이 바보야!! 나도야 이 바보야 흘긓ㄱㄱ",
      "en": "Hey, you idiot!! Me too, you idiot!! ㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미안",
      "en": "Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "근데 혹시 이것만큼은 꼭 커버무대로 보여주고싶다라는 노래있어?",
      "en": "Is there a song you absolutely want to perform as a cover someday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음 내가 잘하는 장르 노래 아무거나 알앤비나",
      "en": "Hmm... probably any genre I'm good at, like R&B."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "케이팝 댄스 커버도 해보고싶거",
      "en": "I'd like to try doing a K-pop dance cover too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음",
      "en": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언젠가 할 기회가 오겠지!",
      "en": "I'm sure I'll get the chance someday!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "07즈 하면 좋겠다 커버",
      "en": "It'd be nice if the '07 line did a cover together."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재밌을거같으",
      "en": "I think it'd be fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그때 07즈 커버 거부한거 아니야?ㅋㅋ",
      "en": "Didn't you reject doing a cover with the '07 line before? ㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ내가언제!!",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ When did I ever do that!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런 분위기였어 ㅋㅎㄹㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "That was just the vibe back then. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치만",
      "en": "But,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나중에 할수있다면",
      "en": "if we get the chance later,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재밌겠다",
      "en": "I think it'd be fun."
    }    ,
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "07즈 브레인 맞지? 배지전쟁 보고 의심되는데",
      "en": "You're the brains of the '07 line, right? I'm starting to doubt it after watching Badge War."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지나간 이야기입니다~",
      "en": "That's all in the past~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잊으세요",
      "en": "Forget about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연아 인사이드 아웃 2 봤어?",
      "en": "Hayeon, did you watch Inside Out 2?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 봐써!!",
      "en": "I did!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 머리속에도 그런애들 있을거같애",
      "en": "I feel like there are little guys like that inside my head too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 내 머리속은 대가족일듯",
      "en": "But I think my mind would be one big family."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "꽉차서",
      "en": "It'd be packed."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "1분마다 번갈아가면서 조종해서",
      "en": "They'd take turns controlling me every minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자아가 여러개야",
      "en": "I've got so many different personalities."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이머리에는 육각단밖에없서",
      "en": "There's nothing in your head except the Hexagons."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞는말하네",
      "en": "You're not wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "육각이는 꼭 있을듯",
      "en": "Hexagon is definitely in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 진한 초록색에 까칠이 남자버전처럼 생겼을거같음",
      "en": "I imagine he'd be dark green and look like the male version of Grumpy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "육각이가 조종하는순간",
      "en": "The moment Hexagon takes control..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 상여자 카리스마",
      "en": "I'd become this super charismatic,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "폭발 완전 멋있는 여성 자아가 될듯",
      "en": "cool, confident woman."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "응 아니야 ㅋ",
      "en": "Yeah... no. ㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 왜",
      "en": "Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그건 매일이잖아🤍",
      "en": "Because you're already like that every day. 🤍"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마자 헤헤",
      "en": "True. Hehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "상여자 아 상여자 좋아",
      "en": "A confident woman... I like confident women."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 좋은거네",
      "en": "So that means you like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "육각이 인형 제작해서 팔고싶네",
      "en": "I want to make and sell Hexagon dolls."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일부 수입은 저도 주시는건가요",
      "en": "Am I getting part of the profits too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그렇다면 찬성합니다…",
      "en": "If that's the case, then I approve..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "今からアイスクリーム食べるけど、何味がいい？",
      "en": "I'm about to eat some ice cream. What flavor should I get?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "초코!!!",
      "en": "Chocolate!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 갱쟝히 단게 땡겨요",
      "en": "I'm suuuper craving something sweet right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "일본어도 읽을줄 알아?",
      "en": "You can read Japanese too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 당연하지ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 나잖아 왜이래ㅎ",
      "en": "Of course I can. ㅋㅋㅋㅋ It's me, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "天才だね",
      "en": "You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞습니다",
      "en": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "위에는 아이스크림 추천해주라고 한거고",
      "en": "The one above asked me to recommend an ice cream flavor."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이건",
      "en": "And this one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "천재로군..이라고",
      "en": "says, \"You're a genius.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했슴",
      "en": "That's what it says."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞지?",
      "en": "Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나",
      "en": "I've"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일본어 연습생때부터 배움 진ㅁ자로",
      "en": "been learning Japanese since I was a trainee, seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "못하는게없네",
      "en": "There's nothing I can't do."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어뜨키지",
      "en": "What should I do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "누가 나 한국어 못한데",
      "en": "Who says I can't speak Korean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 시험볼때 유일하게 자신있게 푼게 국어야!!",
      "en": "The only subject I was ever confident taking exams in was Korean!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자신만있는게 문제였지만",
      "en": "The problem was that confidence was all I had."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "올라운더 실격",
      "en": "Disqualified as an all-rounder."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아하잇",
      "en": "Ahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "까비데스",
      "en": "So close-desu."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "좀 멋있다..?",
      "en": "That's kind of cool...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런거에서 매력을 느끼는군",
      "en": "So this is the kind of thing you find charming."
    }    ,
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "항상 자신감 넘치게 하는 비결이 있어?",
      "en": "Is there a secret to always being so confident?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음",
      "en": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐든 긍정적이게 생각하면",
      "en": "If you think positively about everything,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거대로 따라가잖아",
      "en": "things tend to follow that mindset."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그것처럼",
      "en": "Just like that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 날 칭찬하고 사랑하면",
      "en": "if I compliment myself and love myself,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "남들도 그렇게 느끼게되고",
      "en": "other people end up seeing me that way too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무ㅗ",
      "en": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런거 가태",
      "en": "I think it's something like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이는 슬럼프 겪을 때 어떻게 극복했어?????",
      "en": "How do you overcome a slump, Hayeon?????"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 극복하려고 하지 않아",
      "en": "I don't try to overcome it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 우울하거나 슬플때",
      "en": "When I'm depressed or sad,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 우울하고 슬퍼해",
      "en": "I just let myself be depressed and sad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 진짜 맘놓고 슬퍼하고",
      "en": "I let myself be completely sad,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고나면 괜찮아져",
      "en": "and after that, I feel okay again."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 잊는성격이라",
      "en": "I tend to forget things easily,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "차라리 다 쏟아내고 힘들어하고 잊는게",
      "en": "so I'd rather let everything out, go through the pain, and then forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "계속 안남고",
      "en": "That way it doesn't stay with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋은거같애 나한테는",
      "en": "I think that's what works best for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 특이한게",
      "en": "What's kind of unusual about me is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스트레스받는일이 있었으면",
      "en": "when something stresses me out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더 힘든감정으로 잊어야해서",
      "en": "I overwrite it with an even stronger emotion."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "슬픈영상 찾아서보고 울어 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "I look up sad videos, watch them, and cry. ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고 나면 사라져",
      "en": "After that, it's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 신기해",
      "en": "It's really amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "소모해버려야되는구나",
      "en": "So you have to let it all out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마자",
      "en": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 요즘은 이렇게",
      "en": "But these days,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "육각단이랑 얘기하고 나면",
      "en": "after talking with the Hexagons like this,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋은거같애",
      "en": "I feel better."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "골든벨 꼴찌했을땐 뭐보고 잊었어?",
      "en": "When you came in last on Golden Bell, what did you watch to forget about it?"
    },
